---
import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="Private Policy">
  <Section>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h2>

          <div class="">
            <p>
             Effective Date: January 1, 2024
The information we collect may include:
            </p> 

            <p>
             Asset Analytix is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose information about you when you visit our website.
            </p>



          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Information We Collect</h2>
    
   
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
              <li> Contact information, such as your name, email address, and phone number.</li>
              <li>Information about your business, such as your company name and job title.</li>
               <li>Information about your use of our website, such as your IP address, browser type, and operating system.</li>
                <li>Information about your interactions with us, such as your inquiries and requests.</li>


          
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">How We Use Your Information</h2>   
          <p>We may share your information with:</p>

          <div class="">
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li> Provide, maintain, and improve our website.</li>
              <li>Respond to your inquiries and requests.</li>
              <li>Communicate with you about our products and services.</li>
              <li>Send you marketing communications.</li>
              <li>Detect, investigate and prevent fraudulent transactions and other illegal activities.</li>
            
              <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>

            </ul>
          </div>



          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Sharing of Your Information</h2>   
          <p>We may share your information with:</p>

          <div class="">
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li> Service providers who perform services on our behalf.</li>
              <li>Other users of our website.</li>
              <li>Communicate with you about our products and services.</li>
              <li>Third parties as required by law or to protect our rights.</li>
       

            </ul>
          </div>


           <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Your Choices</h2>   
            <p>You may opt out of receiving marketing communications from us by following the instructions in those communications.</p>


          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Security</h2>   
          <p>We will take considerable measures to help protect information about you from loss, theft, misuse, and unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, and destruction.</p>

              <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Changes to Our Privacy Policy</h2>   
          <p>We may change this Privacy Policy from time to time. If we make changes, we will notify you by revising the date at the top of the policy and, in some cases, we may provide you with additional notice (such as adding a statement to our website or sending you a notification).</p>
         

          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Contact Us</h2>   
          <p>If you have any questions or concerns about our Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a class="text-accent">privacy@assetanalytix.com.</a>

            

</p>

        </div>


           <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 my-11">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Cookies Policy</h2>

          <div class="">
            



          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Introduction</h2>

          <p>This Cookies Policy explains how AssetAnalytix.com ("Website") uses cookies and similar technologies to collect and use information about you. This policy should be read in conjunction with our aforementioned Privacy Statement.</p>
       

           <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">What are Cookies? </h2>
          <p>Cookies are small text files that are placed on your device by websites you visit. They are used to store information about your preferences and activities on the website. Similar technologies like web beacons and pixels may also be used to collect information.</p>


              <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">What types of Cookies do we use?</h2>
          <p>We use the following types of cookies on the Website:</p>

            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
              <li> Essential Cookies: These cookies are necessary for the Website to function properly. They allow you to navigate the Website and use its features, such as accessing secure areas.</li>
              <li>Performance Cookies: These cookies collect information about how you use the Website, such as the pages you visit and the links you click. This information helps us to improve the Website and make it more user-friendly.</li>
               <li>Functionality Cookies: These cookies allow us to remember your preferences on the Website, such as your language and location settings. This makes your browsing experience more convenient and personalized.</li>
                <li>Targeting Cookies: These cookies are used to deliver targeted advertising to you based on your interests and browsing activity.</li>


          
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 ">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">How do we use Cookies?</h2>   
          <p>We use cookies for the following purposes:</p>

          <div class="">
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
              <li>To improve the user experience on the Website.</li>
              <li>To analyze how the Website is used.</li>
              <li>To personalize your experience on the Website.</li>
              <li>To deliver targeted advertising to you.</li>
            

            </ul>
          </div>



          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">How can I control Cookies?</h2>   
          <p>You can control how cookies are used on your device by adjusting your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to block or delete cookies. You can also set your browser to notify you when a cookie is placed on your device.</p>
      
          <p>Please note that if you block or delete cookies, some features of the Website may not function properly.</p>

    
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Third-party Cookies</h2>   
            <p>In addition to the cookies we place on your device, some third-party services that we use may also place cookies on your device. These third-party cookies are subject to the privacy policies of the respective third-party providers</p>


          <div class="">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Contact Us</h2>   
          <p>If you have any questions about this Cookies Policy, please contact us at <a class="text-accent">privacy@assetanalytix.com.</a></p>

        </div>

     
  </Section>
</Layout>
